A spec-driven workflow needs a way to see how far the implementation
has come against a spec, and what the spec must still say before the
rest can be planned. Writing that report by hand is slow and its shape
drifts from one report to the next.

The skill gives every spec the same report next to it, with evidence
for each claim, refreshed and committed as the work moves. It keeps
an existing sclr report.org from being overwritten.
